{"id": "EUVD-2026-89023", "enisaUuid": "d71d9fb7-cfef-3b1f-8134-190830594a4f", "description": "UnoPim versions before 2.0.1 and 2.1.1 trust all connecting clients as proxies and honor the X-Forwarded-Host header without validation, allowing unauthenticated attackers to inject arbitrary origins into admin layout pages. Attackers can set X-Forwarded-Host to redirect JavaScript asset loading to their server, and when responses are cached by shared proxies, subsequent administrators execute attacker-supplied code in their authenticated sessions.", "datePublished": "2026-09-29T15:42:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-02T12:10:19", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/unopim/unopim/commit/77e33618df5ba82fc9c9a32d137368e5bbe5ac9c", "https://github.com/unopim/unopim/releases/tag/v2.0.1", "https://github.com/unopim/unopim/releases/tag/v2.1.1", "https://github.com/unopim/unopim/blob/v2.1.0/bootstrap/app.php#L24", "https://github.com/unopim/unopim/blob/v2.1.0/packages/Webkul/Admin/src/Resources/views/components/layouts/index.blade.php#L9", "https://github.com/unopim/unopim", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/unopim-2.0.0-before-2.0.1-and-2.1.0-before-2.1.1-cache-poisoning-via-x-forwarded-host"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-102630", "GHSA-2jxw-296x-mgxh"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3205808e-13a4-30ef-837b-fc7f0b9c5df5", "product": {"name": "unopim", "vendor": {"name": "unopim"}}, "product_version": "2.1.0 <2.1.1"}, {"id": "d7c5ed14-2c99-346d-9348-2c384e638266", "product": {"name": "unopim", "vendor": {"name": "unopim"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.0.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "71d1e7ca-f00b-34cd-94d2-b42743870387", "vendor": {"name": "unopim"}}], "isExploited": false}